{"id":"junto","lemma":"junto","pos":"prep","rank":244,"glosses":["next to, together with, alongside","along with, together with, alongside","in conjunction with"],"ipa":"/ˈxunto/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-junto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Siéntate junto a mí.","en":"Sit beside me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501141"},{"text":"Camino junto a ella.","en":"I'm walking beside her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461733"},{"text":"Tomás cantó junto a María.","en":"Tom sang with Mary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501650"},{"text":"¿Puedo sentarme junto a ti?","en":"Can I sit beside you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453231"},{"text":"Tom regresó junto a Mary.","en":"Tom got back together with Mary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/805944"}]}